================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY DATA
================================================================================

The tables in data/ are derived summary statistics — scores, ranks, medians,
and detection fractions — computed by this project from public resources
(SURFY, TCGA, GTEx, CZ CELLxGENE Discover, UCSC Xena TOIL). No raw or
individual-level data from those resources is redistributed here.

The CC BY 4.0 grant above covers this project's own contribution to those
tables. The underlying resources carry their own terms and citation
requirements, which are listed in DATA.md and which users of this repository
are responsible for honoring.
